&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="line-height: 1.1;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brilliant Team: Work with international colleagues with strong academic and professional experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work–life balance: Flexible working hours and an environment that respects your time and focus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="line-height: 1.1;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stable Environment: Join a market leader with a reliable product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="line-height: 1.1;"&gt;Direct Exposure to C-level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="line-height: 1.1;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Competitive salary &amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;Relocation Support to Berlin&lt;/p&gt;
